n-8834 buttons-button-834" href="https://app.t-dx.com/onboarding/start#en"> <div class="text-padding-3 text-padding-834"> <div class="text-10 text-mdmedium">Sign up</div> </div> </a> </div> </div> </header> </div> <div class="scam-alert-banner"> <strong>Scam alert:</strong> A fraudulent AI trading application named “AI App Solution”,
