    that you are using our official websites and never share personal or financial information with
    suspicious parties. Taurus’ official websites are: <a href="https://taurushq.com">https://taurushq.com</a> and <a href="https://t-dx.com">https://t-dx.com</a> </div>  <div class="section-13 section"> <div class="container-28 container"> <div class="content-46"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-13 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-badge-8 heading-and-badge"> <div class="badge-group-3"> <div class="badge-12 badge"> <div class="text-56 text-smregular"> Issuers </div> </div> <div class="content-50"> <div class="message-3 text-smregular"> TDX FOR ISSUERS </div> </div> </div> <h1 class="heading-26 display-xlsemibold"> Issue, manage and trade digital securities in an easy and secure way </h1> </div> <p class="supporting-text-17 supporting-text"> It&#39;s new and easy to get started </p> </div> <div class="actions-12 actions"> <a class="buttons-button-24 buttons-button" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-11 text-padding"> <div class="text-57 text-lgmedium">Contact us!</div> </div> <img class="arrow-narrow-right-3" src="/img/arrow-narrow-right@2x.png" alt="arrow-narrow-right"> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-28 container"> <div class="content-51"> <div class="macbook-pro-mockup-3"> <div class="overlap-group-3"> <img class="shadow-3" src="/img/logomark-5.png" alt="Shadow"> <img class="mac-book-pro-16-3" src="/img/macbook-pro-16.png" alt="MacBook Pro 16"> <img class="camera-3" src="/img/camera@2x.png" alt="Camera"> <img class="logo-3" src="/img/card-4@2x.png" alt="Logo"> <div class="screen-mockup-replace-fill-3"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="background-pattern-3" src="/img/background-pattern-3.png" alt="Background pattern"> </div> <div class="features-section-6 features-section"> <div class="container-31 container"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-14 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="subheading-8 subheading text-mdsemibold"> Secure and simple </div> <div class="heading-and-icon-3"> <div class="heading-27 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Tokenize for Growth </div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-18 supporting-text text-xllight"> Digitize your securities to access new possibilities. </p> </div> <div class="content-52"> <article class="feature-text-14 feature-text"> <div class="content-47"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-21 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-48 text-xlmedium">Tokenization</div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Digitize equity, debt, employee incentive plans. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text-14 feature-text"> <div class="content-47"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-22 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-48 text-xlmedium">Administration</div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Administer and transfer your securities 24/7. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text-14 feature-text"> <div class="content-47"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-23 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-48 text-xlmedium">Capital raise</div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Fuel your growth fundraising with existing and new investors. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text-14 feature-text"> <div class="content-47"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-24 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-48 text-xlmedium"> Liquidity creation </div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Launch a trading segment for your investors and employees. </p> </div> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> <div class="features-section"> <div class="container-29 container"> <div class="content-46"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-15 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-6 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="subheading-7 subheading text-mdsemibold"> Time for a change </div> <p class="heading-22 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Digital securities are here. <br>New access, new benefits </p> </div> <p class="supporting-text-19 supporting-text"> Exploring TDX&#39;s pioneering role in tokenized securities. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-32 container"> <div class="content-53"> <div class="frame-7-1"> <div class="feature-text-15 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <div class="check-verified-01-3"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Digital</div> <p class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Transfer in real time real securities anytime anywhere 24/7. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-16 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <img class="zap-3" src="/img/zap-9@2x.png" alt="zap"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Compliant</div> <p class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Our ledger-based securities meet the Swiss Code of Obligations regulatory requirements. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="frame-7-1"> <div class="feature-text-15 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <div class="shield-tick-3"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Secure</div> <p class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Protect your assets with banking-grade security powered by Taurus technology, trusted by leading banks. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-15 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <div class="coins-01-2"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Private equity</div> <div class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Easily turn your company shares into digital tokens to unlock both primary and secondary markets. </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="frame-7-1"> <div class="feature-text-15 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <img class="command-2" src="/img/command-2@2x.png" alt="command"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Private debt</div> <p class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Digitize debt to streamline operational tasks including automated coupons payments. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-15 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-4"> <img class="cube-outline-2" src="/img/cube-outline-2@2x.png" alt="cube-outline"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-19 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-49 text-xlmedium">Others</div> <div class="supporting-text-16 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Tokenizing assets beyond traditional boundaries ranging from funds, real estate, art and commodities </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="section-divider-3" src="/img/section-divider-4.png" alt="Section divider "> <div class="pricing-page-header-3"> <img class="logomark-3" src="/img/logomark.png" alt="logomark"> <div class="header-section-3"> <div class="container-29 container"> <div class="content-46"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-16 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-7 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="subheading-7 subheading text-mdsemibold"> TDX Pricing </div> <div class="heading-22 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Simple pricing </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="section-14 section"> <div class="container-33 container"> <div class="content-54"> <div class="pricing-tier-card-3"> <div class="header-10 header"> <div class="heading-and-price"> <div class="heading-and-badge-9 heading-and-badge"> <div class="heading-23 text-lgsemibold"> Tokenize </div> <div class="badge-13 badge"> <div class="text-59 inter-medium-pink-flamingo-14px"> Start plan </div> </div> </div> <div class="price-6"> <div class="price-7 display-mdsemibold"> CHF 6,500 <span class="text-size: smaller"> setup</span> </div> <div class="period-wrap-5"></div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Upgrade to digital securities. </p> </div> <div class="actions-13 actions"> <a class="buttons-button-20 buttons-button" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-51 text-mdsemibold"> Get started </div> </div> </a> <a class="buttons-button-21 buttons-button" href="https://meetings-eu1.hubspot.com/taurus/meet-us"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-52 text-mdsemibold"> Chat to sales </div> </div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="content-48"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-20 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-53 text-mdsemibold">Features</div> </div> <div class="check-items"> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Digitize 100% or part of your securities </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Identify securities holders via KYC </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <div class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Manage digital securities </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pricing-tier-card-3"> <div class="header-8 header"> <div class="heading-and-price"> <div class="heading-and-badge-10 heading-and-badge"> <div class="heading-23 text-lgsemibold"> Trade on TDX </div> </div> <div class="price-6"> <div class="price-7 display-mdsemibold"> Upon request </div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Create liquidity on a secondary marketplace </p> </div> <div class="actions-14 actions"> <a class="buttons-button-20 buttons-button" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-51 text-mdsemibold"> Get started </div> </div> </a> <a class="buttons-button-21 buttons-button" href="https://meetings-eu1.hubspot.com/taurus/meet-us"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-52 text-mdsemibold"> Chat to sales </div> </div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="content-48"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-20 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-53 text-mdsemibold">Features</div> </div> <div class="check-items"> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Trading segment for one security </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Configurable : open/restrict access </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <div class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Maintenance &amp; custody included </div> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-55 roobert-medium-fiord-16px"> Admissions to trading on TDX: Due diligence fees </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pricing-tier-card-3"> <div class="header-8 header"> <div class="heading-and-price"> <div class="heading-and-badge-11 heading-and-badge"> <div class="heading-23 text-lgsemibold"> Raise capital </div> </div> <div class="price-6"> <div class="price-7 display-mdsemibold"> Upon request </div> <div class="period-wrap-5"></div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-15 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Finance your growth with investors </p> </div> <div class="actions-15 actions"> <a class="buttons-button-20 buttons-button" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-51 text-mdsemibold"> Get started </div> </div> </a> <a class="buttons-button-21 buttons-button" href="https://meetings-eu1.hubspot.com/taurus/meet-us"> <div class="text-padding-10 text-padding"> <div class="text-52 text-mdsemibold"> Chat to sales </div> </div> </a> </div> </div> <div class="content-48"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-20 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-53 text-mdsemibold">Features</div> </div> <div class="check-items"> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Integrated module / landing page </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Investors KYC &amp; AML check included </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <p class="text-54 text-mdlight"> Cash + documentation reception &amp; reconciliation </p> </div> </div> <div class="check-item-text-3"> <div class="check-icon-7"></div> <div class="text-wrap-3"> <div class="text-55 roobert-medium-fiord-16px"> Add-ons: Prospectus legal fees </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="TestimonialsCarousel375" class="testimonial-section-1"> <testimonials-carousel-small id="carousel-287135" data-id="carousel-287135">  <div class="container-17 container"> <div class="content-25"> <div class="content-26"> <div class="quote-and-attribution-1"> <div class="x-and-s"> <div class="cards-info-1"> <div class="content-27"> <div class="title-1 text-xlsemibold"> <div data-astro-source-file="/Users/nicolasducruet/Documents/code/tg-trade-gui-portal/src/components/TestimonialsCarousel375.astro" data-astro-source-loc="13:59" style="font-size: 16px;">
