    suspicious parties. Taurus’ official websites are: <a href="https://taurushq.com">https://taurushq.com</a> and <a href="https://t-dx.com">https://t-dx.com</a> </div>  <div class="section-8 section overflow-hidden"> <div class="container-22 container"> <div class="content-31"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-9 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-badge-7 heading-and-badge"> <div class="badge-group-2"> <div class="badge-8 badge"> <div class="text-40 text-smregular"> Issuers </div> </div> <div class="content-35"> <div class="message-2 text-smregular"> TDX FOR ISSUERS </div> </div> </div> <h1 class="heading-19 display-xlsemibold"> Issue, manage and trade digital securities in an easy and secure way </h1> </div> <p class="supporting-text-10 supporting-text"> It&#39;s new and easy to get started </p> </div> <div class="actions-8 actions"> <a class="buttons-button-17 buttons-button" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-8 text-padding"> <div class="text-41 text-lgmedium">Contact us!</div> </div> <img class="arrow-narrow-right-2" src="/img/arrow-narrow-right@2x.png" alt="arrow-narrow-right"> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-20 container"> <div class="content-36"> <div class="macbook-pro-mockup-2"> <div class="overlap-group-2"> <img class="mac-book-pro-16-2" src="/img/macbook-pro-16.png" alt="MacBook Pro 16"> <img class="camera-2" src="/img/camera@2x.png" alt="Camera"> <div class="screen-mockup-replace-fill-2"></div> </div> <img class="logo-2" src="/img/card-4@2x.png" alt="Logo"> <img class="shadow-2" src="/img/logomark-5.png" alt="Shadow"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="background-pattern-2" src="/img/background-pattern-2.png" alt="Background pattern"> </div> <div class="features-section-4 features-section"> <div class="container-23 container"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-10 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="subheading-6 subheading text-mdsemibold"> Secure and simple </div> <div class="heading-and-icon-2"> <div class="heading-20 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Tokenize for Growth </div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-13 supporting-text text-xllight"> Digitize your securities to access new possibilities. </p> </div> <div class="content-37"> <div class="feature-text-12 feature-text"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-15 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-32 text-xlmedium">Tokenization</div> <p class="supporting-text-11 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Digitize equity, debt, employee incentive plans. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-12 feature-text"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-16 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-32 text-xlmedium">Administration</div> <p class="supporting-text-11 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Administer and transfer your securities 24/7. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-12 feature-text"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-17 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-32 text-xlmedium">Capital raise</div> <p class="supporting-text-11 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Fuel your growth fundraising with existing and new investors. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-12 feature-text"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-18 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-32 text-xlmedium"> Liquidity creation </div> <p class="supporting-text-11 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Launch a trading segment for your investors and employees. </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="features-section-5 features-section"> <div class="container-20 container"> <div class="content-31"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-11 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-4 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="subheading-5 subheading text-mdsemibold"> Time for a change </div> <p class="heading-15 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Digital securities are here. <br>New access, new benefits </p> </div> <p class="supporting-text-10 supporting-text"> Exploring TDX&#39;s pioneering role in tokenized securities. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-24 container"> <div class="content-38"> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <div class="check-verified-01-2"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Digital</div> <p class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Transfer in real time real securities anytime anywhere 24/7. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="zap-2" src="/img/zap-9@2x.png" alt="zap"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Compliant</div> <p class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Our ledger-based securities meet the Swiss Code of Obligations regulatory requirements. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <div class="shield-tick-2"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Secure</div> <p class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Protect your assets with banking-grade security powered by Taurus technology, trusted by leading banks. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <div class="coins-01-1"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Private equity</div> <div class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Easily turn your company shares into digital tokens to unlock both primary and secondary markets. </div> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="command-1" src="/img/command-1@2x.png" alt="command"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Private debt</div> <p class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Digitize debt to streamline operational tasks including automated coupons payments. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-13 feature-text"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="cube-outline-1" src="/img/cube-outline@2x.png" alt="cube-outline"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-13 text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-33 text-xlmedium">Others</div> <div class="supporting-text-12 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Tokenizing assets beyond traditional boundaries ranging from funds, real estate, art and commodities </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="section-divider-2" src="/img/section-divider-2.png" alt="Section divider "> <img class="section-divider-2" src="/img/section-divider-3.png" alt="Section divider "> <div class="pricing-page-header-2"> <img class="logomark-2" src="/img/logomark.png" alt="logomark"> <div class="header-section-2"> <div class="container-20 container"> <div class="content-31"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-9 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-5 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="subheading-5 subheading text-mdsemibold"> TDX Pricing </div> <div class="heading-15 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Simple pricing </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="section-9 section"> <div class="container-25 container"> <div class="content-39"> <div class="pricing-tier-card-2"> <div class="header-7 header"> <div class="heading-and-price"> <div class="heading-and-badge-6 heading-and-badge"> <div class="heading-16 text-lgsemibold"> Tokenize </div> <div class="badge-9 badge"> <div class="text-43 inter-medium-pink-flamingo-14px"> Start plan </div> </div> </div> <div class="price-4"> <div class="price-5 display-mdsemibold"> CHF 6,500 <span class="text-size: smaller"> setup </span> </di