    suspicious parties. Taurus’ official websites are: <a href="https://taurushq.com">https://taurushq.com</a> and <a href="https://t-dx.com">https://t-dx.com</a> </div>  <div class="section overflow-hidden"> <div class="container-1 container-10"> <div class="content"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-badge-1"> <div class="badge-group badge-4"> <div class="badge"> <div class="text-9 text-smregular"> Issuers </div> </div> <div class="content-4"> <div class="message text-smregular"> TDX FOR ISSUERS </div> </div> </div> <h1 class="heading-4 display-xlsemibold bp4-animate-enter" show-on-scroll> Issue, manage and trade digital securities in an easy and secure way </h1> </div> <p class="supporting-text-3 supporting-text-7 bp4-animate-enter1" show-on-scroll> It&#39;s new and easy to get started </p> </div> <div class="actions"> <a class="buttons-button-5 buttons-button-7 bp4-animate-enter2" show-on-scroll href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-2 text-padding-3"> <div class="text-10 text-lgmedium">Contact us!</div> </div> <img class="arrow-narrow-right" src="/img/arrow-narrow-right@2x.png" alt="arrow-narrow-right"> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-2 container-10"> <div class="content-5"> <div class="macbook-pro-mockup"> <div class="overlap-group"> <img class="mac-book-pro-16" src="/img/macbook-pro-16.png" alt="MacBook Pro 16"> <img class="camera" src="/img/camera@2x.png" alt="Camera"> <div class="screen-mockup-replace-fill bp4-animate-enter3" show-on-scroll></div> </div> <img class="logo" src="/img/card-4@2x.png" alt="Logo"> <img class="shadow" src="/img/logomark-5.png" alt="Shadow"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="background-pattern" src="/img/background-pattern.png" alt="Background pattern"> </div> <div class="features-section"> <div class="container-3 container-10"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-1 heading-and-supporting-text-5"> <div class="subheading-1 text-mdsemibold">Secure and simple</div> <div class="heading-and-icon heading-and"> <div class="heading-5 roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Tokenize for Growth </div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-4 supporting-text-7 text-xllight"> Digitize your securities to access new possibilities. </p> </div> <div class="content-6"> <article class="feature-text"> <div class="content-1"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-2 text-and-supporting-text-6"> <div class="text-1 text-xlmedium">Tokenization</div> <p class="supporting-text text-mdlight"> Digitize equity, debt, employee incentive plans. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text"> <div class="content-1"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-3 text-and-supporting-text-6"> <div class="text-1 text-xlmedium">Administration</div> <p class="supporting-text text-mdlight"> Administer and transfer your securities 24/7. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text"> <div class="content-1"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-4 text-and-supporting-text-6"> <div class="text-1 text-xlmedium">Capital raise</div> <p class="supporting-text text-mdlight"> Fuel your growth fundraising with existing and new investors. </p> </div> </div> </article> <article class="feature-text"> <div class="content-1"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-5 text-and-supporting-text-6"> <div class="text-1 text-xlmedium">Liquidity creation</div> <p class="supporting-text text-mdlight"> Launch a trading segment for your investors and employees. </p> </div> </div> </article> </div> </div> </div> <div class="features-section-1"> <div class="container-4 container-10 bp4-animate-enter5" show-on-scroll> <div class="content"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-2 heading-and-supporting-text-5"> <div class="heading-and-subheading heading-and"> <div class="subheading text-mdsemibold"> Time for a change </div> <p class="heading roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Digital securities are here. <br>New access, new benefits </p> </div> <p class="supporting-text-5 supporting-text-7"> Exploring TDX&#39;s pioneering role in tokenized securities. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-5 container-10 bp4-animate-enter6" show-on-scroll> <div class="content-7"> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <div class="check-verified-01"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Digital</div> <p class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Transfer in real time real securities anytime anywhere 24/7. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <img class="zap" src="/img/zap-9@2x.png" alt="zap"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Compliant</div> <p class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Our ledger-based securities meet the Swiss Code of Obligations regulatory requirements. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <div class="shield-tick"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Secure</div> <p class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Protect your assets with banking-grade security powered by Taurus technology, trusted by leading banks. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <div class="coins-01"></div> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Private equity</div> <div class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Easily turn your company shares into digital tokens to unlock both primary and secondary markets. </div> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <img class="command" src="/img/command-1@2x.png" alt="command"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Private debt</div> <p class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Digitize debt to streamline operational tasks including automated coupons payments. </p> </div> </div> <div class="feature-text-1"> <div class="featured-icon"> <img class="cube-outline" src="/img/cube-outline-4@2x.png" alt="cube-outline"> </div> <div class="text-and-supporting-text"> <div class="text-2 text-xlmedium">Others</div> <div class="supporting-text-1 supporting-text-7 text-mdlight"> Tokenizing assets beyond traditional boundaries ranging from funds, real estate, art and commodities </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <img class="section-divider section-5" src="/img/section-divider.png" alt="Section divider "> <div class="pricing-page-header"> <img class="logomark" src="/img/logomark.png" alt="logomark"> <div class="header-section header-2"> <div class="container-6 container-10"> <div class="content"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-3 heading-and-supporting-text-5 bp4-animate-enter7" show-on-scroll> <div class="heading-and-subheading-1"> <div class="subheading text-mdsemibold"> TDX Pricing </div> <div class="heading roobert-medium-mirage-36px"> Simple pricing </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="section-1 section-5 bp4-animate-enter8" show-on-scroll> <div class="container-7 container-10"> <div class="content-8"> <article class="pricing-tier-card"> <div class="header"> <div class="heading-and-price heading-and"> <div class="heading-and-badge heading-and"> <div class="heading-1 text-lgsemibold"> Tokenize </div> <div class="badge-1 badge-4"> <div class="text-12 inter-medium-pink-flamingo-14px"> Start plan </div> </div> </div> <div class="price"> <div class="price-1 display-mdsemibold"> CHF 6,500 <span class="text-size: smaller"> setup</span> </div> <div class="period-wrap"></div> </div> <p class="supporting-text-2 supporting-text-7 roobert-regular-normal-fiord-16px"> Upgrade to digital securities. </p> </div> <div class="actions-4"> <a class="buttons-button-1 buttons-button-7" href="/contact?s=issuers"> <div class="text-padding-1 text-padding-3"> <div class="text-4 text-mdsemibold"> Get started </div> </div> </a> <a class="button